{
 "file": "15MKR02B base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:1bc",
   "ptr": "0x1bc",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「リールは町の宿屋で寝かしてます。\\n",
   "en": "\"We've put Riel to bed at the inn in town. She can't get proper rest here, you see.\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:1e3",
   "ptr": "0x1e3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ここではおちついて寝られませんから\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:1bc"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:20c",
   "ptr": "0x20c",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "　ね」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:1bc"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:24f",
   "ptr": "0x24f",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "「ここは我々の研究棟です。\\n",
   "en": "\"This is our research building. We mainly study ruins from all over the land.\"",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:26e",
   "ptr": "0x26e",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　主に、各地の遺跡を研究してます」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:24f"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:2cd",
   "ptr": "0x2cd",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「町の北にある遺跡へは行きましたか？\\n",
   "en": "\"Been to the ruins north of town? They're this town's famous sight, open even to tourists, you know?\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:2f6",
   "ptr": "0x2f6",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　あそこはこの町の名物として、観光客\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:2cd"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:31f",
   "ptr": "0x31f",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　にも開放されてるんですよ？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:2cd"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:37a",
   "ptr": "0x37a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「遺跡の地下の水は、いくら汲み出して\\n",
   "en": "\"No matter how much water we pump out of the ruins' basement, it doesn't go down at all. If only the water were gone, we could survey down there...\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:3a3",
   "ptr": "0x3a3",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　も全く減らないのです。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:37a"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:3c0",
   "ptr": "0x3c0",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　水さえ無くなれば地下を調査できるの\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　も全く減らないのです。",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:37a"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:3e9",
   "ptr": "0x3e9",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　に・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:37a"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:42f",
   "ptr": "0x42f",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「遺跡の地下部分には不思議な結界が\\n",
   "en": "\"A strange barrier covers the underground part of the ruins, so no light from outside gets in.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:456",
   "ptr": "0x456",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　張られていて、外の光が入って来な\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:42f"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:47d",
   "ptr": "0x47d",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　いんだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:42f"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:48d",
   "ptr": "0x48d",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　魔法による点灯も効かないし、\\n",
   "en": "Magic light doesn't work, and we can't use fire until the water drains... It's a real headache.\"",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:4b0",
   "ptr": "0x4b0",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　水が引かないと火は使えないし・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:48d"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:4d9",
   "ptr": "0x4d9",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "　困ったもんだよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:48d"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:51b",
   "ptr": "0x51b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「遺跡の地下部分には、たぶん、《４つ\\n",
   "en": "\"I think one of the four Lapis is probably kept in the underground part of the ruins.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:544",
   "ptr": "0x544",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　のラピス》の、どれかが納められてる\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:51b"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:56d",
   "ptr": "0x56d",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　と思うんだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:51b"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:581",
   "ptr": "0x581",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　遺跡で見つかった石盤を解読して解っ\\n",
   "en": "That's what we learned from deciphering a stone tablet found in the ruins...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:5aa",
   "ptr": "0x5aa",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　たことなんだけど・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:581"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:5c8",
   "ptr": "0x5c8",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　それらは《混沌の回廊》への道を開く\\n",
   "en": "It says they open the way to the Corridor of Chaos.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:5f1",
   "ptr": "0x5f1",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　という。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:5c8"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:601",
   "ptr": "0x601",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　この地の古代語の隠（いん）ゆとして、\\n",
   "en": "In this land's ancient tongue, 'chaos' is a metaphor for the Black Dragon.",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:62c",
   "ptr": "0x62c",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　混沌とは《黒竜》のことさ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:601"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:64e",
   "ptr": "0x64e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　でも、それ以上のことは、まだ解って\\n",
   "en": "But beyond that, we still don't know a thing. We don't even know what sort of things these Lapis are...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:677",
   "ptr": "0x677",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　ないんだよ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:64e"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:68a",
   "ptr": "0x68a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ラピスとやらが、どんな品なのかも解\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　ないんだよ。",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:64e"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:6b3",
   "ptr": "0x6b3",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　らないし・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:64e"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:6c9",
   "ptr": "0x6c9",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そもそも、《黒竜》そのものが実在す\\n",
   "en": "For that matter, whether the Black Dragon itself even exists... ......\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:6f2",
   "ptr": "0x6f2",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　るのかどうか。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:6c9"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:707",
   "ptr": "0x707",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　・・・・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　るのかどうか。",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:6c9"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:71f",
   "ptr": "0x71f",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「《封印の門》さえ開けられれば、\\n",
   "en": "\"If only we could open the Gate of Seals, we could find out if the Black Dragon is real...\"",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:744",
   "ptr": "0x744",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　黒竜の存在を確かめられるんだが\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:71f"
  },
  {
   "id": "15MKR02B:769",
   "ptr": "0x769",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　なァ・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 15MKR02B:71f"
  }
 ]
}
